[
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0279.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "2e3c67e657bce3b3eb17d928e40ddc0ca4c8cd5621080bef2fc021815c761a77",
    "target": "虽然利用过贵族和市民……可从未利用过与我们处境相同的穷人。为什么要做到这种地步……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0279.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "f83003a6a732654fa6070a70ce70cc2c75002d875f20ac1d60294681b6332cf9",
    "target": "你……什么也不懂。凭现在的贝尔米利昂，不管做什么，都是以卵击石。不用比现在更恶毒、更肮脏的手段……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0279.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "d21f5d87796cdc32a00c78032529541d56ecbe8544b3e07f33d28908fe3c900f",
    "target": "这不像你……果然是温贝特的命令吧？是这样吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0279.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0280.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "3c7bfb4954847a6766cbbbdaa9b130792ff72410e578e6ae8793e6bb5dd85fc6",
    "target": "罗普玛，怎么了？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0280.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "83989e4e76a785501a15b33c090a417a35d6f5a58e8bf12b547453dd477f0e9d",
    "target": "……这孩子是我弟弟。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0280.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "0a471972bb6bb1cae8734b0e536726194f0748123f3e0ad2d89fcf51a0030acb",
    "target": "变了，变成怪物了……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0280.fpb:text:3:4",
    "source_sha256": "d97ef7b2302bf1193702d859d41a05f273ea0fdaa230ddb4aa76f4b85bbcb41f",
    "target": "就是因为你没能果断结束他的性命，才变成这样。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0280.fpb:text:4:5",
    "source_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0280.fpb:text:5:3",
    "source_sha256": "b6eac80b80eadd3842e02a6f5ca35cdaa4ae618fc6d5d86f671d3dc803570fc4",
    "target": "已经没救了。除了杀死他……没有办法。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "957f1b7fce8433c116d2ebe687de9cc56d6f4eca14754cf8d4e446fbaf745515",
    "target": "……乔伊。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "6f6d16a794bd7d78647811c8704eacdd44dca3198baa9f4f6605d1b9dfd6a167",
    "target": "罗普玛……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "718688eaeb09a6569521a90037cd3bd835fbcd0cd53e8bc2d01337359adfdd57",
    "target": "全都死了……也许，来的路上杀掉的怪物里，就有我的家人。已经变了模样……也许连认都没认出来，就杀了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "eb2e1cbe4d668eb949cf8b461d4e7ca2eabdfab4e513d7b07f22c92e9777403a",
    "target": "最后，杀死乔伊的也是我。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "7593aa73b5f37303a7bc56921d1e21f58a95928dfde3b8a22b0eb3b5a76f9c53",
    "target": "萝洁，到这一步，总不能还说贝尔米利昂是对的吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0281.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "e99e9dace7abff51800792b8c3c6a9103b9fe950a1f4092a40d85364e54b12b9",
    "target": "……所以，我才和费尔南争吵。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "32b504ca2e90e701592d18f891057814fb7a0fd1fdaf55e1585aaf9179883d9f",
    "target": "卡林兹组长，我明确下令封锁，你竟敢违抗。这次，我得到了代替总队长处理此事的权限。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "3da670556697412c00e775de603803568d550b83e39ffb079811c85f380dd5b0",
    "target": "所以呢？因为这里住着交不起税的穷人，就没有保护的义务？要是修德尔米尔，你绝不会封锁，对吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "afd568378c7f3a423074ff7c8261e8276d62616e4b398dc6e6aa7cfd34339d4d",
    "target": "我知道，艾贝尔是你的故乡。家人遇难，我也深感遗憾。不过……你是军人，本该更加冷静地判断。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "deb4ad89efe6be7283fa4449b9371904fd277fc3ccd5d8d9f48b76cffed5c25e",
    "target": "威廉明娜……要是哥哥，绝不会封锁这里。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "40330a77dfaea6ac97688a41f5bcd91dd39fa55bee1598561281322cfc505acd",
    "target": "我是审视情况后，作出了最佳判断。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "fa3dbbf3a7d3a23ac5e1b8db445802e2a0daced4e0e34743ca46199129b3707c",
    "target": "封锁就是最佳判断？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "554991b60db9c66c572166de1709c9d21fec8d1a8b42973e50e7dbdaad35a3db",
    "target": "够了，切尔西。威廉明娜，这次完全是我没能管好部下的责任，任何处分，我都会接受。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "ee00ca85b93cb1247fe50182d441951c210f8e322327f739fe9ea0aa1010293f",
    "target": "为什么要你这家伙低头？艾贝尔的人死了，全是威廉明娜害的！既然是军人，不就该多保护一个人算一个吗？不管自己会不会死！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "c5babf2d08d3725c8542b5d2135f5c0768a174d930bdbada949c361446a4abb9",
    "target": "罗普玛，要是这里不是你的故乡，你也不会如此愤怒吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "57d520c9b8cf2fc64fb740fff9e2cfd3c91d4a46a9d7999678b26b593bbffc2a",
    "target": "什、什么？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0282.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "31b669af0affb1d155c35e274d802b555806a5f702f1226ff9c7e6bdc3473e9d",
    "target": "现在，所有权限都在我手里。因此，请立刻撤离，这是命令。对你们的处分，会由总队长决定。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "79c5ae1d1cf4b8eef7da4006e6e431cef7012d400ad449c79aef2eb31e011f45",
    "target": "可恶……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "f3338057cd6fc7e0e7d4d24cc82e96dd95b5416b00fca01f5a67951b614acf44",
    "target": "攻击艾贝尔不错，那里也远离修德尔米尔。施加灵印，尽可能扩散怪物，施瓦茨最终就不得不亲自出动。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "be72b7c4d7cd1d5450d527f86ec28524bbf5f195ff888aaf45b3ea93ead6425d",
    "target": "施加灵印，尽可能扩散怪物，施瓦茨最终就不得不亲自出动。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "fa58d2c0ba0a05134bcca93259199a84ceb7deac612ed798ea43908bb2d8d9f5",
    "target": "可……那里是贫民窟。竟然要让那里的人承受灵印……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "f05fd6bb4801725b8262ec6cbaf5082195b6af7b98ba5b2264c47a6c2b3ffe8f",
    "target": "修德尔米尔外，大多都是这种地方吧。至少把施瓦茨引到那里，皇女那边才好行动。我们已经和那个女人订立契约了，以重建克罗伊斯为条件……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "8fa16f57a006c5bb1407c76541065f4172b910baffba62eb20967a2f20e3f4a5",
    "target": "我们已经和那个女人订立契约了，以重建克罗伊斯为条件……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "3b45db12b66d8398de9db5b57c90882a9ed16b0cb12a308c08e3e08b7373bfa0",
    "target": "可是……贝尔米利昂一直坚持，至少不攻击和我们同样处境的穷人。我们憎恨的是躲在修德尔米尔安全的城墙里，吃好穿好的那些人。他们把失去祖国的克罗伊斯人当奴隶使唤，待得连狗都不如，做尽了无耻的事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "fca2bf9737c01f96cd67fcca45c2ff14bd01832621fac4d1131a5402f3f0e1b7",
    "target": "我们憎恨的是躲在修德尔米尔安全的城墙里，吃好穿好的那些人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "ab24e995ceaee958e1c02fa2b4d01d6c833bb935ccc9a78445a038ad4210e156",
    "target": "他们把失去祖国的克罗伊斯人当奴隶使唤，待得连狗都不如，做尽了无耻的事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "71033437c020a056d05bc3eaf2bb738c702f1a5929574098834134c90c396b68",
    "target": "正是因为你总这样，连部下也自然动摇。明明知道，凡事都要付出代价，为什么还如此？代价越惨烈，不就越能接近目标？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "fd363e1d088217bc04f971f59fdbdd81101c9b8dfff5b3e53c621eb659437492",
    "target": "明明知道，凡事都要付出代价，为什么还如此？代价越惨烈，不就越能接近目标？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "c8767a07a004bdce2f6fad0fefd9a6da9421c1d21ef6b5432deebad4a3afd82f",
    "target": "我……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "2dee975c19b5c1c60ab455884374f4873398bbda9c3b84bb5bc97bd788dc0ad3",
    "target": "反正，流的血已经够多了。居然仅仅因为可怜，就犹豫不决。重建克罗伊斯在即，你却打算崩溃？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "469bf5d5169548e681ae8702a3d3c149a20037198bba365697750ab526f11258",
    "target": "居然仅仅因为可怜，就犹豫不决。重建克罗伊斯在即，你却打算崩溃？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "b367b7d113dd95ad2479dbefede11f9f08d2caeacb1079ae589de2095319ccd9",
    "target": "……到底什么才是对的？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "bd1804a300d0a8a3396305ebb9ac1cbabe34ea5c9013227f2670e84cc8fc3e04",
    "target": "……就这么不愿弄脏双手吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0283.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0284.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "367f77bb37f3fc4b2014bbd98fa2c2866c04875d54931f0e0d20341ca26a4a02",
    "target": "封锁命令啊……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0284.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "2cadbdb9aed2f6bbf981bd08ad3ca2f902afcb8b9b98ee3c6adf82087da598d1",
    "target": "是我……做错了吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0284.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "e26cb5146a742f8b0c8a1261b4f63b95e7c91b285bed87659d024865184c47ad",
    "target": "不，并不是要责怪你。怎么看，都是很符合你性格的命令。我不打算说，特别有什么不对。从某个角度看，也许那才是最正确的。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0284.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "8f99a7d8b4f552088aef8d998a1d2c6d07580a4b99ad0c04973a321da10e2152",
    "target": "当然，我也不是不能理解罗普玛的心情。不过，即使我的父母在艾贝尔，我也会下达同样的封锁命令。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0284.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "d4a58e2ac082702e84075ce3c682283b6f76ac568fb884179f4820804a192378",
    "target": "我理解你的心情。总之，艾贝尔的事，处理得很好。想必很累了，回去休息吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0284.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "df05157487c07ae34bfbed79acd6171c691cb9881d128678dffc79ae27ce8243",
    "target": "……明白。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "2d010032bb5b4fe52ddd113e31791836d99026fe20167185664a649dea1f9eb5",
    "target": "不知道罗普玛还好吗？一直不说话……组长也不知道去了哪里……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "6907a4c9d3b122db1bd97eb867a031ca897232955193ee259e849898bef39542",
    "target": "别管，心情郁闷的时候，先静一静更好。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "62e803b0dc689c2b3201e02dce27f6a281bcb5a0b9ead3e61e8392f268ead3da",
    "target": "组长没能一击杀死罗普玛变成怪物的弟弟，肯定是犹豫了吧。总觉得，这很像组长。要是没下封锁令，情况会不会不同？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "e5f0c7e1e6f2438fd30e7f4e93470f55baad3eac98f9e96c4a124cbd8107c098",
    "target": "不……遗憾的是，从某个角度看，也许下封锁令更好。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "6d1b0170204c252fc5230af065e8cc739527d4126e2857d6e736170fa8dd781a",
    "target": "可是……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "a6f7cd4af95a2f16d23102d96734e0905bb4f425a2c36758769eb2623f65cf85",
    "target": "是啊，为了大局牺牲少数……从某个角度看，本来就理所当然。在贝尔米利昂，那是公然进行的事。不过，这次有些不同，仿佛是让贱民替施瓦茨付出牺牲。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0285.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "1058e05ab9dcdb7ae1a631911849e46d2dfc878f1770d2e6ed9b8493106af077",
    "target": "没错……至少，施瓦茨选择了那种方法。怎么看，施瓦茨的命与贱民的命，似乎都不能相提并论。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0287.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "7b111c4004cfa570cf5b9fef7bc0c4faa6958d464a3b30afc33110de47181c74",
    "target": "又浑身是血……为什么会这样？到现在，我到底做了什么？全身都沾着血腥味。$n难道和怪物战斗过？可这些鲜红的血，分明是……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0287.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "a46a33f8916dc366d66f9f7980d890e47a6ebeab28998566d09b4f01514233ab",
    "target": "啊……啊，陛、陛下……陛下……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0287.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "8cd78d032f3f9047c2e8587cbddac2388c09de47e8b341eca471db84418c98f8",
    "target": "陛下？陛下怎么了……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0287.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "d6da969680a2814de6e96631a6f3a4d90bbe32efc9e796b6facebc7033682869",
    "target": "这、这……不可能的事……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0287.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "4030359034a1b573573b1279d1d3fadd6a238d92ca7e4b755eb70d7248033859",
    "target": "出了什么事？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0287.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "4ca785160964971401776d01f00ac9778d58f4075d8c963bf8d3e60e1cfd49a1",
    "target": "快、快……请叫人来，陛下……殿下……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0288.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "a9664593ae7693e01df2333c8a9363a96a6222104411b791a94a83b232f20749",
    "target": "（现在……似乎明白了。仔细想想，妖石里怪物的卡尔塔，能够把人变成怪物。）",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0288.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "967bf6480bfa352427edcc509cb2d79be5225a9ba1436aec214d5e396b2d2758",
    "target": "（我持有的纹章，也确实是强大的希安。只要我愿意，也能做出可怕的事。）",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0288.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "b4bfb28bb7812a3066012979ca557193451734773f363954bba555c6a18db30d",
    "target": "（不过，卡尔塔里，应该不只存在怪物……也有让人变成其他人模样的卡尔塔吧。为什么之前没想到？）",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0288.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "a75493615060ef279b4275ec781d9bbe3fadbc7741a264dcc7b9208889e7e80e",
    "target": "（而且，马拉卡特的纹章，威尔莱特分明……）",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "c21c3c0d9736c2959c6852996624e3e0fbf2ed693fbba54d3918c0b5b9735d93",
    "target": "您、您到底想对我……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "14c15ca1e8251b97bebf0d65da587dd2cde8a4bb1c3157f1f493c31216620e76",
    "target": "别担心，并不打算伤害你。只是有件事想拜托。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "1d5443cd02173b9575844c169042045090a3fa0827f1ba6d8652fd97dbb5b3a7",
    "target": "什么事……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "3399390f60547d9c95934ac2207f22e5bca12725a6ea27e32c99ed8037ca40d8",
    "target": "皇女殿下很快会把你们召进宫。她小时候，可以说是由你们养大的。想必，与年幼的皇女殿下很亲近吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "de0ed09625b03df6c0ea11a72d3b570fa8a16b30396262d20724bc53c37bbbb8",
    "target": "啊，是……当然。殿下年幼时，为了不让周围的人知道身份，大家都称她为小姐。因此，我们亲近得像姐妹。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "f329bcca59e91e1e31fe98fa5c12788f0210597c2d47ff1f9f829337a31bf7d7",
    "target": "……还记得殿下持有的吊坠吧？也能认出，它是什么样子吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "73049525d8d429a61e9a17b25113ab256820b29ef4e540a67e429c2a39fc67d8",
    "target": "大概……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "1514ae05364acee4a5ea83c4f637e0ae759f1f31833cb4b38e630e089e94cda1",
    "target": "好。事情办成，我就给你相应的报偿。一定是你这辈子，都不可能接触到的数目……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "6ecf2efb5957fa179108b76d06d6862c9de959e1c1c2bbeb7050b47fd920b160",
    "target": "……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0289.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "92bf8ce54334d707a5e5d4f554883e426f45127c9e42e0ffbc4b232e5a308e35",
    "target": "怎么样？这样，肯帮我的忙了吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "da055216b80cd8afa07235eb6f62b540a322557f6f0de5f9bc88ca8631736541",
    "target": "总队长，是我，您在里面吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "097d381b46a43a59f72301be529e86dda73340548839cbfb22d2bfad4395b7c3",
    "target": "怎么了？出事了吗？如此慌张，不像你的作风。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "9b9b92e5a752f886bec4699b5fee90797dbe5aa572157f2e219ed810b2c9fb28",
    "target": "大事不好了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "817eee0475e36c9eb49430e510c94e4db7232bcd93a7918690a3c3441b8d0168",
    "target": "刚刚……传来噩耗。皇帝陛下与……太后殿下，被暗杀了……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "6c91161aaf366c47b77aadf954873df5ff8aa10f6270f5bb0314f02e6dbf073a",
    "target": "什么……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "e3efe63559aaeb36ed31192e627eb332bb1e088887ce15ada64d891fef09c98e",
    "target": "而且……还有消息说，暗杀皇帝陛下与太后殿下的凶手……竟然是卡林兹组长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "ae0f5491f875a0d8bd4aa41c4a3f654ba127b7470fa80b09edac17c5a3185ff6",
    "target": "卡林兹……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "5ed71e8475e05756811d5decbf9c3174739e01bb062e24764ec66a3b463a0ae7",
    "target": "更严重的是，以皇女殿下和奥拉坎威尔莱特为首的贵族们，都异口同声，说这次暗杀的幕后主使……就是总队长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "3a5053ce60c7137044017bb6888cfdfe8ab28c3569c40e14dcc8253b86fb9b17",
    "target": "奥拉坎威尔莱特。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "6e2d2d5242eb579ae2636f4e72335b22c7d64234b994cfca4dee6f63d8aeb333",
    "target": "奥拉坎，怎么来到这里了……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "9a994804b21305560723220a2fc490973f41543b1dfb8424515a0af6d7c2830e",
    "target": "奥拉坎吉尔伯特，奉皇女殿下之命，以指使暗杀皇帝陛下与太后殿下的嫌疑，将你逮捕。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "00a6b789fe741170b8dfeefe07ce92fd2f5137981c2a4ed6c0aba2754dae9a13",
    "target": "这……不可能，总队长绝不会……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "2f91478b9c8d3baab60582e09b13e35f7a25a3335c62dfec6e558a39c8d6372a",
    "target": "……好。我亲自去皇宫，面见皇女殿下，证明自己无罪。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0290.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "9dcb3d689a911d468e42fbed7ef58bfb36e7550d1d07fd73cef63723f517ea43",
    "target": "证明无罪？好啊。要是能证明，就试试看。",
    "state": "translated"
  }
]
